<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian Treasury sells 11.5 mln dinars of notes.</title>
<headline>Tunisian Treasury sells 11.5 mln dinars of notes.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Tuesday said it sold 11.5 million dinars of three-year notes at its weekly auction on October 15, repaying maturing paper totalling 0.3 million dinars.</p>
<p>The three-year notes payable in equal annual tranches were at a 9.1250 percent yield, unchanged from their level last week.</p>
<p>Banks bid for 109 million dinars of three-, four- and five-year notes at respectively 9.1250, 9.1875 and 9.5 percent. ($=0.97 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
